cles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Space - Visual Ideation Workspace</title>\n  \n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n  <style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Chewy&family=Patrick+Hand&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"relative min-h-screen overflow-hidden text-[#f1f5f9] box-border m-0\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 1px, transparent 1px), #09090b; background-size: 48px 48px; font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\">\n\n  <section class=\"relative min-h-screen overflow-hidden\">\n    \n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <header class=\"relative z-30 flex items-stretch justify-between border-b border-[#27272a] bg-[#09090b]/92 backdrop-blur-[18px] shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] h-[96px] max-lg:h-[78px]\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-stretch\">\n        <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Space Home\" class=\"flex items-center justify-center border-r border-[#27272a] w-[112p